    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Educational institutions are embracing a transformative approach to leadership by empowering school leaders to become true champions of learning. The Aga Khan University Institute for Education Development, East Africa (IED, EA) in partnership with Muni University in Arua, Uganda have launched a Diploma programme in Educational Leadership and Management (DELM).",
